---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Raid Network — grow together">
  <a slot="right" class="btn primary" href="/auth/login">Sign in with Twitch</a>
  <main class="wrap hero">
    <section class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">For small & mid-size streamers</div>
      <h1>Your next raid partner is <span class="hl">live right now.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Raid Network finds streamers in your game at about your size (half to double your viewers), maps who raids whom, and lets two chats battle on one shared overlay.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn primary lg" href="/auth/login">Sign in with Twitch</a>
        <a class="btn lg" href="/dashboard/">Open dashboard →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stats mono">
        <div><b>0.5×–2×</b><span>size-matched partners</span></div>
        <div><b>1 click</b><span>raid or duel</span></div>
        <div><b>2 chats</b><span>one live board</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 420 380" class="constellation">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#44e1ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ff4fa3"/></linearGradient>
          <marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#b79cff"/></marker>
        </defs>
        <g stroke="#b79cff" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arr)">
          <path d="M90 90 Q 160 40 222 82" /><path d="M240 110 Q 300 160 318 230" /><path d="M300 262 Q 200 320 128 270" />
          <path d="M110 250 Q 70 180 86 118" /><path d="M120 110 Q 170 170 200 196" /><path d="M232 200 Q 280 120 330 92" />
        </g>
        <path d="M200 205 L 330 92" stroke="url(#g1)" stroke-width="3" class="flow" />
        <g>
          <circle cx="80" cy="100" r="22" fill="#44e1ff" /><circle cx="235" cy="92" r="16" fill="#8b5cf6" />
          <circle cx="325" cy="245" r="26" fill="#ff4fa3" /><circle cx="115" cy="262" r="18" fill="#8b5cf6" />
          <circle cx="212" cy="205" r="30" fill="#c8ff4d" /><circle cx="342" cy="84" r="14" fill="#b79cff" />
        </g>
        <text x="212" y="210" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Unbounded" font-weight="800" font-size="13" fill="#12091f">YOU</text>
      </svg>
    </section>
  </main>
  <section class="wrap features">
    <article class="panel"><div class="panel-body"><div class="eyebrow">01 · Matchmaking</div><h3>Partners your size</h3><p class="muted">Live streamers in your game ranked by size, shared tags, language and who raided you, each with Raid and Duel buttons.</p></div></article>
    <article class="panel"><div class="panel-body"><div class="eyebrow">02 · Network map</div><h3>See your raid web</h3><p class="muted">A live graph of who raided whom. Find the communities you're part of and the channels that always show up.</p></div></article>
    <article class="panel"><div class="panel-body"><div class="eyebrow">03 · Duels</div><h3>Chat vs chat</h3><p class="muted">Challenge a streamer to a tug-of-war or a poll. Both chats vote from their own channel, and one overlay shows the result on both streams.</p></div></article>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5.2vw, 66px); margin: 18px 0; }
  .hl { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lime), #7dffb0 40%, var(--a)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
  .lede { font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin: 28px 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stats { display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stats div { display: grid; }
  .stats b { font-size: 22px; color: var(--text); }
  .stats span { color: var(--dim); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .constellation { width: 100%; filter: drop-shadow(0 30px 60px rgba(139,92,246,.35)); }
  .constellation circle { animation: bob 6s ease-in-out infinite; transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; }
  .constellation circle:nth-child(2n) { animation-delay: -2s; }
  .flow { stroke-dasharray: 8 10; animation: flow 1.2s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes flow { to { stroke-dashoffset: -36; } }
  @keyframes bob { 50% { transform: translateY(-6px); } }
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .features h3 { font-size: 20px; margin: 10px 0 6px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .hero, .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
